{
  "name": "@solx/web-web",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "//": "@solx/http and @solx/surface (from the sibling solx-js repo) are not npm deps here — they're aliased straight to their TS source via vite.config.ts's resolve.alias + tsconfig.json's compilerOptions.paths. Both packages are zero-dependency and browser-safe as-is, so there's nothing to install or build first.",
